s the bomb, the other defuses it.<br>Simple. Clean. Profitable for me either way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Team</strong> \u2013 Get in, plant the package, protect it until it blows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defuse Team</strong> \u2013 Stop them. Cut the right wire. Don\u2019t cut your own fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, tactical maps designed for maximum tension (and maximum shouting at your friends).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is a fresh chance to redeem yourself\u2026 or to be the reason your team loses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/2c24318d27043798edd3b06aad78bd26.webp?t=1755081863\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Keep Playing?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I said so.<br>And because you\u2019ll unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bases to decorate <i>and</i> weaponize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to raid other players\u2019 bases, just to prove you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons, more gadgets, more bad decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.poster.avif?t=1755081863\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.webm?t=1755081863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.mp4?t=1755081863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re in my company now.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed with the Plan A.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and we move to Plan B4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail that\u2026 we\u2019ll just reuse your codename for the next recruit.</p>","developers":["olivato","Von Bonin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/f93de97289152430cc9f11946141c9bcf64b1ebf/header.jpg?t=1755081863","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any modern UNIX<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> (64 bit) 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or ATI DirectX11 Compatible Graphics Card<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3423700/814455/22601ea10d716a0786c54af8fec14730f36a45f8/1750849546/dash_av1.mpd?t=1738433011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3423700/814455/22601ea10d716a0786c54af8fec14730f36a45f8/1750849546/dash_h264.mpd?t=1738433011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3423700/814455/22601ea10d716a0786c54af8fec14730f36a45f8/1750849546/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1738433011","id":257089940,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257089940/movie480.mp4?t